{"Date": "02/22/2018", "Record Number": "ZCBL2018-0066", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Business License", "Description": "For Goodness Sake is a small research company focusing on sex education in Berkeley. We work on bridging academic research and content production. We partner with University professors to conduct the first-ever large-scale studies about sexual pleasure. Then we turn the findings into published journal articles for scientists/academics and into relatable, refreshingly honest content for the public. We're growing to create research/content about the ways sexual pleasure changes during pregnancy and postpartum, during menopause, on sexual-side-effect medications and more. We utilize the space at 2930 Shattuck Ave. Suite 206 for desktop work, curriculum design, and other in office work.", "Project Name": "For Goodness Sake LLC", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "02/22/2018", "ZCBL2018-0066", "Zoning Certificate Business License", "For Goodness Sake is a small research company focusing on sex education in Berkeley. We work on bridging academic research and content production. We partner with University professors to conduct the first-ever large-scale studies about sexual pleasure. Then we turn the findings into published journal articles for scientists/academics and into relatable, refreshingly honest content for the public. We're growing to create research/content about the ways sexual pleasure changes during pregnancy and postpartum, during menopause, on sexual-side-effect medications and more. We utilize the space at 2930 Shattuck Ave. Suite 206 for desktop work, curriculum design, and other in office work.", "For Goodness Sake LLC", "Approved", "", "", "", "2930 SHATTUCK Ave, 206, BERKELEY CA 94705"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=18PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00305&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
